The  driver  supports  PCI SCSI host adapters based on the Tekram
TRM‐S1040 SCSI ASIC.  Supported SCSI controllers include: PCI Ul‐
tra SCSI adapter without flash BIOS and internal  SCSI  connector
PCI  Ultra SCSI adapter without flash BIOS PCI Ultra SCSI adapter
with flash BIOS PCI Ultra‐Wide SCSI adapter with flash  BIOS  PCI
Ultra‐Wide  SCSI adapter with flash BIOS and 68‐pin external SCSI
connector For Tekram DC‐390 PCI SCSI host  adapter,  use  driver.
For  Tekram DC‐310/U and DC‐390U/UW/F PCI SCSI host adapters, use
driver.  The driver was originally written for by Erich  Chen  of
Tekram  Technology,  and  Rui‐Xiang Guo rewrote the driver to use
and for 1.6.
